   <text:p text:style-name="P47" loext:marker-style-name="T36"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P105" loext:marker-style-name="T36"><text:span text:style-name="T36">The RAB software interface has four main areas: The </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T94">Menu bar</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">, the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T95">Tool bar</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">, the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T101">Project menu area (tree view)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36"> and the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T102">Configuration </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">area. These will be referenced in the various chapters.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52" loext:marker-style-name="T36"/>
