     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660018" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link"><text:soft-page-break/>4.3.<text:span text:style-name="T108"><text:tab/></text:span>How can I find the setting or feature that I need in my RAB project?<text:span text:style-name="T118"><text:tab/>27</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660019" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.4.<text:span text:style-name="T108"><text:tab/></text:span>How should I choose the app package name?<text:span text:style-name="T118"><text:tab/>28</text:span></text:a></text:p>
