     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660028" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.10.<text:span text:style-name="T108"><text:tab/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">Can I build apps when I do not have internet access?</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T118"><text:tab/>30</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660029" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.11.<text:span text:style-name="T108"><text:tab/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">Can I build an app from the command line?</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T118"><text:tab/>30</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660030" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.12.<text:span text:style-name="T108"><text:tab/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">How can I add a horizontal line to separate certain paragraphs in text?</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T118"><text:tab/>32</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660031" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.13.<text:span text:style-name="T108"><text:tab/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">I don’t like the name “Reading App”. Have you thought of calling the app something else?</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T118"><text:tab/>32</text:span></text:a></text:p>
