   <text:p text:style-name="P174" loext:marker-style-name="T36"><text:span text:style-name="T36">When you do this, you will probably get a message “Allow USB Debugging?” Tap </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T48">OK</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">.</text:span></text:p>
