   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T78"><text:span text:style-name="T47">NOTE</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">: to change the font size in the navigation drawer, go to </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T47">Appearance </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T64"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T47"> Interface </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T64"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T47"> Languages</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36"> and double click on an interface language. Change the percentage of the font size higher or lower</text:span></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="_The_Borders_tab"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc233660115"/>The <text:span text:style-name="T78">Borders</text:span> tab<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc233660115"/></text:h>
