     </draw:text-box>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">For the reference popup title, and actual reference background, see <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Footer_Styles_(with" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link">Footer Styles (with reference styles)</text:span></text:a>.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P314" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc233660276"/>Illustrations and Video Styles<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc233660276"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">These are used for formatting the parts of the app screen used for displaying images or videos. <text:s/>This includes formatting the captions and video titles.</text:p>
