   <text:h text:style-name="P314" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="_Footer_Styles_(with"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc233660281"/>Footer Styles (with reference styles)<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc233660281"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">These are used for the various standard formatting requirements for footers, specified under the <text:span text:style-name="T46">Books </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T64"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T46"> Footer</text:span> tab. </text:p>
