   <text:h text:style-name="P314" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="_Contents_Menu_Styles"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc233660282"/>Contents Menu Styles<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc233660282"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">These are used for the various <text:span text:style-name="T46">Navigation</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="T64"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T46"> Contents menu</text:span> elements. </text:p>
